comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T13:15:17.183Z","harness:codex","Duplicate evidence 2026-07-26: all-status searches for linked test PM_PATH merge install schema outside repository, package prepare hooks, source Git identity, and infra collision found no direct item. GH-682 lineage and closed pm-oslr cover adjacent workspace/execution contracts but not prepare-time merge installation. Canonical GitHub issue: GH-743."
